{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>Deck of Harvest</strong>&quot; is a <strong>strategy</strong>  game that combines <strong>Deck Building</strong> with <strong>Farm Sim</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world with four-season cycles, to get through the heat and cold, you need to carefully plan your farmland, build a perfect deck of cards, maximize your harvest, and strive to reach the production target of each season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hidden cards, orders, and treasures during the game, and build a super deck that can yield extremely high output!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seize Harvest Time &amp; Yield Extremely High Output</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Farming Sim</strong>: Sow N + types of crop seeds, let them be nourished day and night, and pursue the maximum yield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Management</strong>: Cleverly plan the planting positions of crops in the limited 9 grids to trigger diverse combination effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harvest Strategy</strong>: Accurately grasp the harvest time and flexibly use the harvest strategies of rows, columns, and a combination of points and areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668640/extras/05d7524916b10483db332a240dd7fc1d.poster.avif?t=1772184338\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668640/extras/05d7524916b10483db332a240dd7fc1d.webm?t=1772184338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668640/extras/05d7524916b10483db332a240dd7fc1d.mp4?t=1772184338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a Unique Deck &amp; Overcome Seasonal Challenges</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Builds</strong>: Unlock 3 types of grains and freely combine them. You'll have a unique building experience in each game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjust Deck</strong>: Carefully adjust the types and proportions of cards in your backpack, select the best cards, and create a deck exclusive to this game to significantly enhance the yield-increasing effect.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relic Buff</strong>: Select amazing treasures and unlock various passive bonuses to boost your farming business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668640/extras/e169cd54d9410091b659148271f0d3e4.poster.avif?t=1772184338\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668640/extras/e169cd54d9410091b659148271f0d3e4.webm?t=1772184338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668640/extras/e169cd54d9410091b659148271f0d3e4.mp4?t=1772184338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668640?t=1772184338","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668640?t=1772184338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668640/8fd52588410d7b1c8a327e2e8fdb3db759de5ad8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772184338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steam