p seeds, let them be nourished day and night, and pursue the maximum yield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Management</strong>: Cleverly plan the planting positions of crops in the limited 9 grids to trigger diverse combination effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harvest Strategy</strong>: Accurately grasp the harvest time and flexibly use the harvest strategies of rows, columns, and a combination of points and areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668640/extras/05d7524916b10483db332a240dd7fc1d.poster.avif?t=1772184338\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668640/extras/05d7524916b10483db332a240dd7fc1d.webm?t=1772184338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668640/extras/05d7524916b10483db332a240dd7fc1d.mp4?t=1772184338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a Unique Deck &amp; Overcome Seasonal Challenges</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Builds</strong>: Unlock 3 types of grains and freely combine them. You'll have a unique building experience in each game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjust Deck</strong>: Carefully adjust the types and proportions of cards in your backpack, select the best cards, and create a deck exclusive to this game to significantly enhance the yield-increasing effect.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relic Buff</strong>: Select amazing treasures and unlock various passive bonuses to boost your farming business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: cente